As a student, I can connect my Canvas account through OAuth.
As a student, I can see my current XP/token balance.
As a student, I earn tokens when a completed assignment meets the agreed timing rule.
As a student, I can buy a virtual item with tokens.
As a student, I can select an owned theme/avatar item.
As a student, I can see my selected visual changes on Canvas.
As a student, I can disconnect my account and remove my stored data.